<title>POLAND: Agros wants to issue 3.4 mln new shares.</title>
<headline>Agros wants to issue 3.4 mln new shares.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food producer and trader Agros SA plans to issue up to 3.425,000 shares, the company said in a statement.</p>
<p>Agros said the shares would be divided into three separate batches offered to current shareholders, selected large investors and the general public.</p>
<p>It gave no further details.</p>
<p>It said the issue has yet to be approved by extraordinary shareholders meeting on November 22.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
